{"v":4,"catch":"你跟我，我們看到的世界，真的是一樣的嗎？\n《不同的冬天》是一款顛覆常識與認知的雙人解謎冒險遊戲。","desc":"《不同的冬天》是一款雙人益智冒險遊戲。玩家將扮演兩個離家出走的男孩，他們必須齊心協力，越過重重阻礙，只為到達男孩們心中那個「遙遠的地方」。和朋友一起踏上旅途，找回那一天的友情吧。","publisher":"KODANSHA","release":"2026-07-29","genres":["動作","冒險","益智","交流"],"players":"網路 2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","葡萄牙文","法文","德文","意大利文","荷蘭文","俄文","韓文","中文 (簡體字)","中文 (繁體字)","泰文","波蘭文"],"pmax":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.3GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/e768c7e66305c3ce26440c6e57ab53aaa6d52996ff2eef79db382864b5c99036.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/8e5592727e3d7eb617944f8d71c48e038b1e5f2a9f7d853b9a8b72bb78db384e.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/aef99addd955b6c006754836632fb0c799cef481fa2eb08c8ce99656c24d4e84.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/a3eb5b12c97cae0f9a5fd77b3449040b1b42cd4b1163030abadaa5dd1bf3b4d4.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/036bb1af6bcaafaa2f83e1071bf3b2d7c4d1e8c8b8eb6852f9a175831b9fe6b2.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/1f68296d94c3a8580582990f16d29463f90dc4618da778f4dc5244bc496ac35e.jpg"],"titleId":"0400d030265d8000","dlc":[]}